us the carried-over 1 equals 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1.\n\nNext, in the millions place: 6 + 5 plus the carried-over 1 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nFinally, in the hundred millions place: 4 + 5 plus the carried-over 1 equals 10. I'll write down 10.Therefore, the answer is"]]
